    <article class="card"><h3>Extension and agouti</h3><p>MC1R (E, e, e^a) and ASIP (A, A^t, a). Black pigment needs E. Bay is A. Seal brown is A^t. Black is a/a. Chestnut is e/e or e/e^a, and it hides agouti.</p></article>
